  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-darkgoldenrod pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Stamina Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/fb/Magnus_Bane_%28The_Mortal_Instruments%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20140108094436\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Magnus Bane (The Mortal Instruments)\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/fb/Magnus_Bane_%28The_Mortal_Instruments%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20140108094436\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/fb/Magnus_Bane_%28The_Mortal_Instruments%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20140108094436 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/fb/Magnus_Bane_%28The_Mortal_Instruments%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1031?cb=20140108094436 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Magnus Bane (The Mortal Instruments)\" width=\"270\" height=\"180\" data-image-key=\"Magnus_Bane_%28The_Mortal_Instruments%29.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Magnus Bane (The Mortal Instruments).jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Magnus Bane (The Mortal Instruments) can absorb others' stamina to strengthen his own.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Steal stamina of others.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>steal stamina and utilize it in some way</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Stamina_Manipulation\" title=\"Stamina Manipulation\">Stamina Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStamina_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Stamina Draining/Leeching/Sapping/Stealing/Theft</li>\n<li>Vigor Absorption/Draining/Leeching/Sapping/Stealing/Theft</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStamina_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can steal the stamina of others, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently. Usually increasing their own and rendering the target tired as a result.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStamina_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enervation_Inducement\" title=\"Enervation Inducement\">Enervation Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition\" title=\"Peak Human Condition\">Peak Human</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Condition\">Enhanced</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Condition\">Supernatural</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absolute Condition\">Absolute Condition</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Stamina\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Peak Human Stamina\">Peak Human</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Stamina\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Stamina\">Enhanced</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Stamina\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Stamina\">Supernatural</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Stamina\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absolute Stamina\">Absolute Stamina</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stamina_Empowerment\" title=\"Stamina Empowerment\">Stamina Empowerment</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStamina_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fatigue_Manipulation\" title=\"Fatigue Manipulation\">Fatigue Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stamina_Manipulation\" title=\"Stamina Manipulation\">Stamina Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStamina_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li>Users of <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Stamina\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absolute Stamina\">Absolute Stamina</a> cannot be completely drained.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStamina_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Warlocks (<i>Battle Realms</i>)</li>\n<li>Mera Salamin (<i>Epithet Erased</i>); via Fragile</li>\n<li>Magnus Bane (<i>The Mortal Instruments</i>)</li>\n<li>Debbie Dazzle (<i>My Babysitter's a Vampire</i>); whoever she stole energy from <a href=\"/wiki/Dollification\" title=\"Dollification\">became dolls</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://myheroacademia.fandom.com/wiki/Rikiya_Katsukame\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bokunoheroacademia:Rikiya Katsukame\">Rikiya Katsukame</a> (<i>My Hero Academia</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nanatsu-no-taizai.fandom.com/wiki/Ban\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:nanatsu-no-taizai:Ban\">Ban</a> (<i>Nanatsu no Taizai/The Seven Deadly Sins</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://questism.fandom.com/wiki/Suhyeon_Kim\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:questism:Suhyeon Kim\">Suhyeon Kim</a> (<i>QUESTISM</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://questism.fandom.com/wiki/Yun_Jo\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:questism:Yun Jo\">Yun Jo</a> (<i>QUESTISM</i>)</li>\n<li>Magnus Bane (<i>Shadowhunter Chronicles</i>)</li>\n<li>Burers (<i>S.T.A.L.K.E.R.</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStamina_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://elderscrolls.fandom.com/wiki/Mace_of_Molag_Bal_(Skyrim)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:elderscrolls:Mace of Molag Bal (Skyrim)\">Mace of Molag Bal</a> (<i>The Elder Scrolls</i>)</li>\n<li>Black Volume of the Dead (<i>Shadowhunter Chronicles</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStamina_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"00ede6442682398a855434146ac08200\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left